# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# Link relations for agent discovery (RFC 8288). Only resources that actually
# exist are advertised: pointing an agent at /.well-known/api-catalog when there
# is no API would be a broken promise, and a 404 behind an advertised relation
# is worse than no relation at all.
#
# `describedby` is the honest relation for llms.txt: it is a description of the
# resource, not a service endpoint. There is no registered relation for llms.txt
# yet, and inventing one to satisfy a scanner would be gaming the check.

/*
  Link: </llms.txt>; rel="describedby"; type="text/plain"
  Link: </sitemap-index.xml>; rel="sitemap"; type="application/xml"
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

/llms.txt
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
